        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG409-355-630, 14\" Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 14 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Handle has mitered corners for an extra modern look. It has a 6 inch mounted center to center and can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This 14 Inch Stainless Steel Door Pull  has a satin stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG409-355-specifications.gif?v=1704354570\" width=\"558\" height=\"210\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG409-355 Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Longer <a href=\"/products/24-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-handle-ahi-sig409-610-630\"><b>24\" Door Handle</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/36-inch-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-handle-ahi-sig409-914-630\"><b>36\" Door Handle</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/48-inch-long-contemporary-stainless-steel-door-handle-ahi-sig409-1220-630\"><b>48\" Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG409-355-630 Contemporary Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Length: 14\" (355 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 12-11/16\" (323 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG409-355-specifications.pdf?v=1691093353\"><b>AHI SIG409-355 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
