                "title": "14 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Handle, AHI SIG409-355-630",
                "description": "The 14 Inch Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Handle has mitered corners for an extra modern look. It has a 6 inch mounted center to center and can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. This 14 Inch Stainless Steel Door Pull  has a satin stainless steel finish. \r\n",
